+
+Tabbed layout
+=============
+
+The "Toggle tabbed layout" action (toggle_tabbed) switches the current desk to
+a tabbed layout, modelled on i3's tabbed containers: the windows of a stack no
+longer split it, they all fill it and a tab bar on top lists them. Only the
+selected tab is visible. Click a tab to select it, scroll over the bar to
+switch tabs.
+
+"Focus next/previous tab (or window)" (tab_next, tab_prev) steps through the
+tabs and carries on into the next stack, landing on its visible tab. When the
+desk is not tabbed they behave like the taskbar-order focus actions, which
+makes them good targets for touchpad gesture bindings.
